note.p:
The vote in the election of April 10, according to preliminary official returns
                    as reported in despatch No. 1639, April 12, from the Ambassador in Germany, was:
                        Hindenburg, 19,359,642 or 53 percent;
                        Hitler, 13,417,460 or 36.8 percent;
                    Thaelmann, 3,706,388 or 10.2 percent (862.00/2722).
